# Kbd

Kbd displays a keyboard shortcut. It is a visual hint, not an interactive control, so place it inside prose, menu items, or a button suffix.

<DocsExample title="Keyboard shortcuts" {source} {htmlSource}><Example /></DocsExample>

Pass modifiers with `meta`, `shift`, `alt`, and `ctrl`. `meta` renders Command on Apple platforms and Control on Windows and Linux. Keep the child to one key, digit, or named key such as `K`, `7`, `Enter`, or `Esc`; use `small` in dense menus and tables.

In long-form copy that must remain readable as plain text, write the shortcut directly. Keep punctuation and words such as “or” outside Kbd.
